    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "In this update, we have added server management experiences for SQL Database in the new Azure Preview portal.  You can now easily reset the server administrator password, and configure firewall rules and default auditing settings for databases in the server.\n\n<a href=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/imported/images-2014-08-Firewall-Settings.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/imported/images-2014-08-Firewall-Settings-300x153.png\" alt=\"Update firewall settings\"></a>",
    "Markdown": "In this update, we have added server management experiences for SQL Database in the new Azure Preview portal. You can now easily reset the server administrator password, and configure firewall rules and default auditing settings for databases in the server."
  },
